{"version":1,"content":"<p>有否想過可以在醫院候診室，欣賞古神廟遺址？</p><p>早前為患上肺腺癌的羅馬天主教教宗良十四世進行肺結節切除手術的羅馬傑梅利綜合醫院，旗下位羅馬小島The Tiberina Island的分院自2013年起推行藝術文化療法，病人可以在候診區透過大型玻璃窗欣賞公元前3世紀的古神廟遺址。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T09:42:33.966113+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":137,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T09:10:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T09:58:05.162396+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T09:37:48.942755+00:00","content_hash":"c69bae64cf0b2c3d3e9a48aac60140c62378184bf323260f6c317c5d854c322a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}